  "title": "451 Research Report Recognizes Leaner and Nimbler Vertiv Thats Found Its Mojo as a Standalone Company",
  "summary": "In a newly released report, IT analyst firm 451 Research welcomed Vertiv, saying the company has “remade itself for a datacenter market that demands a lean cost structure and rewards speed,” adding that Vertiv is now “gearing up to take advantage of its broad portfolio and global footprint to take more share in a challenging but expanding datacenter market.”",
